 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "The particle -pun",
   "texto": [
    "**Pun** is written separately and usually means «too» or «even»: **Warga pun mengungsi** («Residents also took refuge»). Don't confuse her with the composite words written together, like **meskipun**."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "The clytic -nya",
   "texto": [
    "**-nya** is attached to the previous word. You can point to possession or refer to something mentioned above: **penyebabnya** («your cause»), **dampaknya** («su impacto»). The form depends on the context."
   ]
  },
